   "name": "Innkeeper Wiley",
   "npc": "6791",
   "questID": 96339,
   "race": "Orc",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Wait, wait, you said your name was $N?\r\n\r\n$N! I am so glad to finally meet you. Someone delivered a package here addressed to you and assured me that you would eventually come to pick it up. I tried to tell them that we don't do that around here, but before I could get a word in, they were already gone!\r\n\r\nYour timing is great, too. It was gonna be lumped up with all the other garbage that I toss into the sea nightly.\r\n\r\nWhat? We all do it. Ugh, just take your package and go!",
   "time": 1791497285,
   "title": "Legacy Reward: Replica Ironforge Air Rifle",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  }
